            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Abbie S"
            },
            "reviewBody": "ABSOLUTELY amazing!!! As a college student I didn't have vinegar or onion powder on hand. Other than that I followed the rest of the ingredients and instead of minced garlic, I used garlic powder- and it came out perfectly YUMMY!! So to those few who do not have vinegar and minced onion on hand, No Worries!!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2010-11-28T12:43:44.720Z"
          },
          {
