            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ELLIS917"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this...will make again. The rating is for the recipe as is. My personal taste is a little more \"spicy\", so I will substitute 1/2 Chioptle Mayo for the regular and chop up and add a few dill pickles. Adding my personal preferences will only make a good recipe better!",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-11T07:33:12.410Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
